Local changes to vendored phuryn/pm-skills content:
- skills/discovery, skills/strategy, skills/market-research: skills of the same names in the
  upstream packs pm-product-discovery, pm-product-strategy and pm-market-research.
  Changes: headings in sentence case, en dash instead of em dash, the $ARGUMENTS
  placeholder replaced by "the product the user describes in the conversation",
  code fences carry a language. Not derived from upstream: skills/discovery/insights-from-minute
  (written locally). skills/strategy/north-star-metric derives from the skill of that name in the
  upstream pack pm-marketing-growth.
- skills/delivery (upstream pack pm-execution), skills/go-to-market (upstream packs pm-go-to-market
  and, for marketing-ideas, positioning-ideas, product-name and value-prop-statements,
  pm-marketing-growth), skills/analytics (pm-data-analytics) and skills/toolkit/grammar-check
  (pm-toolkit): skills of the same names. Changes as above. Not derived from upstream:
  skills/go-to-market/customer-value-doc and skills/toolkit/pdf-to-markdown (written locally).
- commands/: 32 of the 38 commands derive from the commands of the same names in the upstream
  packs (pm-execution, pm-product-discovery, pm-product-strategy, pm-market-research,
  pm-go-to-market, pm-toolkit). Changes as above; commands/discover.md was additionally reworked
  (no issue tracker steps, folders from pmos where). Not derived from upstream: fill-idea,
  impact-map, insights-from-minute, pdf-to-md, risk-assessment and start-idea (written locally).

